  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an operator edits one node's config file
  s1 --> s2: you send a message
  s2 --> s3: the gateway starts the turn itself
  s3 --> s4: the answer reaches Discord
  s4 --> s5: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s5 --> s6: an operator edits one node's config file
  s6 --> s7: you send a message
  s7 --> s8: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s8 --> s8: a node reads the owner row again
  s8 --> s9: the old home is asked to end its session
  s9 --> s10: the old home answers the request
  s10 --> s11: the owner row moves to the new home
  s11 --> s12: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s12 --> s13: the gateway's tick picks the target again
  s13 --> s14: the old home is asked to end its session
  s14 --> s15: the old home answers the request
  s15 --> s16: the owner row moves to the new home
  s16 --> s17: the home starts the turn
